iragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);'>\n            铁\n           </span>\n</strong>\n<strong>\n<span style='font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);'>\n            皮卡传统日晒、水洗、蜜处理及厌氧日晒\n           </span>\n</strong>\n          。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: normal;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q3HjNf1JsvbuPlD1ADBvkc6zic3YL4Mb5lUKcQ9k5KsmynibEB1NwZTaujztGiaUc5MR4iaspKIFhGew/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style='text-align: center;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);letter-spacing: 0.034em;'/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: normal;\">\n<strong>\n<span style='font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 12px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);'>\n           日晒水洗蜜处理厌氧日晒\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<p>\n<span style='font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;'>\n          为了还原这一支云南处理法四拼的风味潜力，我们选择了\n         </span>\n<strong>\n<span style='font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);'>\n           快节奏的深烘焙\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style='font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;'>\n          ，配合冷萃液的特征，让口感更醇厚，也拉高焦糖甜感。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style='font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;'>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-wrap: wrap;\">\n           50%水洗+20%蜜处理，打定了咖啡酸甜多汁的深色莓果调性；20%日晒增加了整体甜感，也提升了触感的醇厚度；10%厌氧日晒，则发展出了可可、红酒般的迷人酵感，整体层次丰富清晰，甜度、复杂度都很饱满！\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q3HjNf1JsvbuPlD1ADBvkcIDHRZichyQiaYgPhYqQzU0gpTUIxnfGSAo4CrsNOMHEnt6F0KySeuibQg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style='font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-wrap: wrap;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;'>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-wrap: wrap;\">\n            而通过20小时的低温冷泡+冰滴萃取\n           </span>\n           ，冷萃液\n          </span>\n          入口如酒渍樱桃般的酸甜，随后威士忌的浓醇酒香在嘴里悠悠漫开，余韵带着香甜的可可气息。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">\n          喝的方法也很简单，\n          <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.51px;text-wrap: wrap;\">\n           只要一撕一倒，加150-180ml水/牛奶。\n          </span>\n          加水后就像一杯\n          <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-wrap: wrap;\">\n           莓果酸甜里有\n           <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-wrap: wrap;\">\n            细腻酒香的\n           </span>\n           威士忌\n          </span>\n          ；加奶更放大了酒香、樱桃甜，\n          <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-wrap: wrap;\">\n           像是一杯樱桃+酒香拉满的液体冰巧克力，即使加小半杯冰，浓度依然能打！\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q3HjNf1JsvbuPlD1ADBvkcxPIP20syl9Lv7lVicIYxU3aibhvEkmsk1TufbVqgOVsVCicEfakacswicg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q3HjNf1JsvbuPlD1ADBvkclQyYMLKdLWjgIHKJDEoTQAxquO1SiaZV1UfuBISSGazb49KK8ia5l4nQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style='font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);letter-spacing: 0.034em;'/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: transparent;'>\n            新优惠99元/盒（10支）\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-color: transparent;'>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n<span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;caret-co